# rclone.conf example for Cloudflare R2 (Karen)

Copy to a **gitignored** location (e.g. `%APPDATA%/rclone/rclone.conf` or `~/.config/rclone/rclone.conf`).
Never commit real keys.

```ini
[karen-r2]
type = s3
provider = Cloudflare
access_key_id = YOUR_R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID
secret_access_key = YOUR_R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
endpoint = https://YOUR_CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
acl = private
no_check_bucket = true
```

## Append-only upload (min-dev)

```bash
# Desktop → R2 (no --delete, no sync that prunes remote)
rclone copy ./data/karen-decision-validation/acquisition/normalized/nq-history-archive-1m \
  karen-r2:karen-nq-history/normalized/nq-history-archive-1m/v-local/ \
  --checksum --transfers 2 --checkers 4 --bwlimit 8M

rclone copy ./data/karen-decision-validation/micro-fixtures \
  karen-r2:karen-nq-history/experiments/dev/micro-fixtures/ \
  --checksum --transfers 2 --checkers 4 --bwlimit 8M
```

`--bwlimit 8M` keeps headroom for local DEV jobs. Raise off-peak.

## Raw background (resume-safe)

```bash
rclone copy ./data/karen-decision-validation/acquisition/raw/tickstream-nq-history-archive/by-day \
  karen-r2:karen-nq-history/raw/tickstream-nq-history-archive/by-day/ \
  --checksum --transfers 2 --checkers 4 --bwlimit 4M --fast-list
```

## Pull on laptop (DEV only)

```bash
rclone copy karen-r2:karen-nq-history/normalized/nq-history-archive-1m/v-local/ \
  ./data/karen-decision-validation/acquisition/normalized/nq-history-archive-1m/ \
  --checksum
```

Do **not** pull `experiments/sealed/holdout/`.
